 40+  4010              LINLEN   EQU $F3B0      ; the width of a line of text
 41+  4010              TXTNAM   EQU $F3B3      ; where INITXT puts the tables: names, colours,
 42+  4010              TXTCOL   EQU $F3B5      ; patterns, sprite attributes, sprite patterns
